  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 grant-Enhance democratic process&amp;protecting</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of the programme is to contribute to a more accountable and transparent democratic governance in Zambia in the pre-election, election and post-election periods by supporting civil society advocacy for electoral and political reform. The programme is part of the Team Europe Initiative in which the EU Delegation is funding NDI for civil society to field election observers to monitor 2026 Zambian elections. Sweden is also providing support to NDI to promote women&apos;s access to electoral justice</narrative>
  </description>
